<title>UK: Royal Bank of Scotland sets 150 mln stg 10-yr bond.</title>
<headline>Royal Bank of Scotland sets 150 mln stg 10-yr bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by</p>
<p>lead manager UBS.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ROYAL BANK OF SCOTLAND</p>
<p> AMT    150 MLN STG   COUPON     **	  MATURITY    29.JAN.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    29.JAN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  40 BP     REOFFER    **	  SPREAD	+60 BP</p>
<p> NOTES   ** TO BE PRICED</p>
<p> MOODY	A1 (SUB)  LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  A+ (SUB)  DENOMS (K) 100	 SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  U.K.	TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    20 BP     SELL CONC  20 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 7.5 PCT DECEMBER 2006 GILT</p>
<p> NOTES	SUBORDINATED</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
